{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>About This Game</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outbreak has begun. After a technology company\u2019s experiment went wrong, the population has been turned into ravenous, flesh-eating monsters. Trapped in the ruins of the city, you must fight to survive. Scavenge supplies, battle hordes of infected, and face terrifying bosses as you search for answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death Hive</strong> is a top-down zombie survival shooter combining fast-paced combat, resource management, and exploration. Gather ammo and health packs, use fires to keep warm in the frigid environment, and push deeper into the infested streets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge to survive</strong> \u2013 defeat zombies to find ammo, health, and supplies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Points and Purchases</strong> - Each zombie kill nets you a number of points you can spend at the Merchant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental survival</strong> \u2013 endure the cold by staying near fires.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging boss fights</strong> \u2013 face unique, challenging enemies with different attack styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; discovery</strong> \u2013 uncover survivors, supplies, and the truth behind the outbreak.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Access</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Several new weapons and Items</strong>\u00a0- Available for purchase at the merchant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Endless Mode</strong>\u00a0- A wave and round based challenge game mode on an abandoned farm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Creation</strong> - Create and customize a unique look for your character and save it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple new missions</strong>\u00a0- Areas are unlocked to explore deeper within the city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty setting</strong>\u00a0- Players are given scaled challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Christmas Season is Active -</strong>\u00a0We have a new Seasonal event we're working on, It's Christmas!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survivors</strong> - Coming soon are Survivors and missions surrounding them, making the city feel more alive!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Camera mode</strong> - Our player camera now dynamically moves in certain scenarios, giving a whole new experience.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3910110?t=1766376902","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910110/781e36deee5ebdd3c2924287bc884570bb9e3765/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766376902","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910110/ab9eb8796376bd093989c28e910725e5c2091be8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766376902","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910110/ab9eb8796376bd093989c28e910725e5c2091be8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766376902","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"It is a top-down zombie shooter, with blood effects."},"demos":[{"appid":3912340,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>About This Game</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outbreak has begun. After a technology company\u2019s experiment went wrong, the population has been turned into ravenous, flesh-eating monsters. Trapped in the ruins of the city, you must fight to survive. Scavenge supplies, battle hordes of infected, and face terrifying bosses as you search for 